{"4655610": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Robo Rig", "steam_appid": 4655610, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [4819460], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robo Rig is a 3D, top down, Extraction Bullet Hell where you play as a fully customizable robot. You build your robot, enter battle and destroy enemies, gain coins and collect parts, then you must extract and build an even more powerful robot with the newly acquired parts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can buy parts from the shop, and add them to your robot, parts include lasers, explosive launchers, flamethrowers boosters, turrets armour and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use parts in any way, be as creative as possible and create synergies where the parts work together to make one another more useful.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Robo Rig is a 3D, top down, Extraction Bullet Hell where you play as a fully customizable robot. You build your robot, enter battle and destroy enemies, gain coins and collect parts, then you must extract and build an even more powerful robot with the newly acquired parts!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can buy parts from the shop, and add them to your robot, parts include lasers, explosive launchers, flamethrowers boosters, turrets armour and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use parts in any way, be as creative as possible and create synergies where the parts work together to make one another more useful.</p>", "short_description": "Robo Rig is a 3D, top down, Extraction Bullet Hell where you play as a fully customizable robot. You build your robot, enter battle and destroy enemies, gain coins and collect parts, then you must extract and build an even more powerful robot with the newly acquired parts!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4655610/29825f0eb22